# Hundred-Battle Veteran: "You may cast this card from your graveyard. If you do, it enters with a finality counter on it."
# The counter comes with its own permission only (CR 601.3): cast from the graveyard under Yawgmoth's Will's ("Until end of
# turn, you may play lands and cast spells from your graveyard"), it enters with none. Bot2 Bolts it on turn 2; on turn 3
# Bot1 casts Yawgmoth's Will off a Black Lotus and then the Veteran from its graveyard by the Will, with four Moxen. Bot2's
# second Bolt kills it on turn 4, after the Will's exile replacement has ended: with no finality counter it goes to the graveyard.

